<description>&lt;p&gt;Al-Shabaab continues probe attacks testing Kenya's border defenses while militia forces killed eight Somali civilians near the Kenya-Ethiopia border. Ugandan troops are withdrawing from Somalia, prompting security concerns around Mogadishu, and Uganda denies that its soldiers were killed in the country. Somalia joined 17 nations in condemning an Israeli strike on a Gaza hospital and a Somali refugee woman was killed by Houthi shelling of a camp in Lahj. Rainstorms in Lower Shabelle killed a mother and two children, and protests erupted in Hirshabelle over the regional election as al-Shabaab seized Coomaad. The conflict produced 2,284 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXkFVX3lxTE1vckVTSWFfUjlTckdjNWRfNnJpMHJkdzh4aWZic09LQVFGVkNvTXlIbGtCV0x3VnZ1VHJ4VkFQb0k4ekF2OWYxQ0R5anNJdHJGaWtQcVRwYlNSLVJ6VXfSAWNBVV95cUxQcWhseEI5TFM5SlE0cnRLWTNPMTREdUhxdUwzTF9pTHhIY1FVdjBYWmZRcDVwWXVTOGJxd0k2LWduZ3ZRZ1NCaGFuUHpNa25zSWdIVlpuTVVqcGJyY055RDAwQmc?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimgFBVV95cUxNTXpOeWVOa0h1MFRlb2R2VzVfanh3dHBLRjI1N01pQy1PQ0xfQmVyX29TVVh2SUY1X3RueUNxMUxiWkdQSmcxZ0dfcUI1cnluVVJFaUVWb0lsYmhGTk5mazduLUtySUNSelZyV2NkRnhjbzdJeVdsSGJVRWpGVFZYcmowTF9Hd1hUSlNLVzFvby0zTy12QTFPRVRR?oc=5&quot;&gt;Modern Ghana&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivwFBVV95cUxOVE5hbUhQYnVObVdTcGU5Qkp0X2RSckJNQ0o4bWlybnowemg4eUlfaGZZXzB6UUNKQUNSNkc0R3VwVUxxVWZhVG5vRjJsc0wtQ3FNRmtFb2s4cmdES1RaaUJEZ3dIemRWM2R0OGh4VVpWNlFRNFZUR3o0T2JPZXREdy1vQkZLZ0RNWFpVRTh5TWFrOTFGV0U3TFo3TTdPLWl0TDBYM29NbFBucXhCNkoxTlA1ejNvRm1zQkpDZDdTOA?oc=5&quot;&gt;Horn Observer&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiowFBVV95cUxNUHJ6VzFsa0tVUm83eUdPYW1yaks3NDM0ZW5xclN3VDZxWk1uS0F2S1loclVoNHQ